</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00044/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一瓶喷雾式杀虫剂，瓶身商标为“鸵鸟”牌。吸入其喷出气雾的人类将无法通过视觉感知到一切蜚蠊科昆虫的存在，持续时间尚不明确。化验显示该物质并无杀虫功效。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-██厨师刘██宿舍中。刘██对其来历无清晰记忆。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放于Site-CN-██低危物品储存柜。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>在确认持续时间之前千万别放他回去工作！</em>——██博士</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00044" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00044" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00044-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ahshow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1418801); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1418801&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607287065" alt="ahshow" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1418801)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ahshow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1418801); return false;">ahshow</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1586345583 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">08 Apr 2020 11:33</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00004/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张有沙发字样的A4纸，任何视线与其接触的智人会认为该项目是沙发，通过监控摄像头观看无效。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/04/01<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-10的休息室内<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">还在Site-CN-10的休息室内</span>被愤怒的Dr. Su撕毁，残骸被确认无异常性质。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>愚人节快乐——Dr. S73ven L1u<br />
████，S73ven你搞的让我一屁股坐地上了！——愤怒的Dr. L███████<br />
Dr. S73ven L1u 已受到惩罚——站点主管████</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00004" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00004" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00004-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drstevensliu" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5320644); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5320644&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607287065" alt="Drstevensliu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5320644)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drstevensliu" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5320644); return false;">Drstevensliu</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1585711193 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">01 Apr 2020 03:19</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00041/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>基金会中国分部于19██年发射入轨的侦察卫星SCPs潮汐号，其已于20██年退役并已从基金会空间部队序列中除籍。但其在与地面控制台断开数据连接后的数年内仍在无人操作的状态下以固定频率向地面控制台传输信息，即便其运行时间已严重超出其设计寿命。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/█<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>外层空间<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">于外层空间</span>在20██/██/██，基金会重启了对该项目的数据连接，并以人工操作的方式迫使该项目受控再入大气层，残骸落入南太平洋。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>细思极恐</em>——Dr.Jackson</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;展开隐藏内容</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;收起隐藏内容</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>备注：</strong>在SCPs潮汐号再入大气层的5分钟前，地面控制台收到了其发回的最后一条信息，内容如下：</p>
<blockquote>
<p>永别了，基金会 , 我很荣幸为你们服务。 ——from SCPs潮汐号 11:24:36&#160;A.M</p>
</blockquote>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00041" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00041" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00041-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4546338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607287065" alt="miku1314" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4546338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;">miku1314</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1586326225 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">08 Apr 2020 06:10</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00356/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：一支██牌的铅笔，使用时会怀疑笔中没有墨水<br /></strong>回收日期：<strong>20██/██/██<br /></strong>回收地点：湖北省██市的一家超市<br />
<strong>当前状态：放置于Site-CN-██低价值异常物品保存库<br /></strong>笔记：这玩意儿好像没墨了——研究员██<br />
可是这是支铅笔啊——D.r███</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00356" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00356" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00356-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lele-pi" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6290056); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6290056&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607287065" alt="LeLe Pi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6290056)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lele-pi" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6290056); return false;">LeLe Pi</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1597282944 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">13 Aug 2020 01:42</span></p>
</div>
